{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/6/95688879f2d2c0dbc46e942dde231791e7b23773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w + x + y + z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" /> by solving the Sudoku puzzle below.\n</p>\n<pre>_ _ _ <b>|</b> _ 4 _ <b>|</b> _ z _\n1 _ 6 <b>|</b> _ _ _ <b>|</b> 7 _ 3\n5 _ _ <b>|</b> 9 _ _ <b>|</b> _ _ 2\n<b>---------------------</b>\n_ 8 3 <b>|</b> w 2 _ <b>|</b> 5 _ _\n2 _ _ <b>|</b> 5 _ 9 <b>|</b> _ _ 7\n_ _ 7 <b>|</b> _ 8 _ <b>|</b> 9 2 _\n<b>---------------------</b>\n3 _ _ <b>|</b> _ _ 1 <b>|</b> _ _ 6\n8 _ 9 <b>|</b> x _ _ <b>|</b> 3 _ 5\n_ y _ <b>|</b> _ 3 _ <b>|</b> _ _ _\n</pre>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/4949837942b77c9d7850f5be2034f0838db7af4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }2\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }4\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }6\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }8\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }9\\qquad \\textbf{(F) }10\\qquad \\textbf{(G) }11\\qquad \\textbf{(H) }12\\qquad \\textbf{(I) }13\\qquad \\textbf{(J) }14\\qquad \\textbf{(K) }15\\qquad \\textbf{(L) }18\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"946\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/7/2371a3a63fe895ea315eec9ba44ab185da8fdbd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(M) }19\\qquad \\textbf{(N) }20\\qquad \\textbf{(O) }23\\qquad \\textbf{(P) }24\\qquad \\textbf{(Q) }25\\qquad \\textbf{(R) }26\\qquad \\textbf{(S) }28\\qquad \\textbf{(T) }30\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"660\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-hea